### GET request to fetch all workers
GET http://localhost:3000/workers

### GET request to fetch a specific worker by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/workers/1

### POST request to create a new worker
POST http://localhost:3000/workers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_date": "2023-10-01",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "salary": 50000
}